  (text "FPGA decoupling: 100 nF at each of pins 12, 37 (VCC) and 36, 1, 25 (VCCX, VCCIO0/1)" (at 190.5 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 97d5d4be-27bf-5114-89c6-797a8d99b8f5))
  (text "Configuration: internal flash (autoboot), MODE1=MODE0=0 via 4.7k pull-downs.\nRECONFIG_N, DONE, READY open-drain with 4.7k pull-ups; MCU sees FPGA_DONE and drives FPGA_RECONFIG.\nJTAGSEL_N pulled up (JTAG pins dedicated); close JP501 to force JTAG if they were reused as GPIO." (at 260.35 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7dca778a-9c6d-5771-b4e8-9d5f8a226907))
