  (text "J501 programming header: Würth WR-WST 490107671612 (Redfit IDC, footprint only),\npinout of the yanartas sensing board J3. FPGA JTAG (TCK/TMS/TDI/TDO, DBG2 = FPGA pin 6)\nand the STM32G474 SWD / UART / NRST / DBG1 (mcu_if; NRST 100 nF at the MCU).\nHOST_RX/HOST_TX named as on the sensing board (MCU = host): HOST_RX = MCU RX (PA10).\n1 VBUS 2 HOST_RX 3 +3V3 4 HOST_TX 5 DBG2 6 GND 7 TCK 8 SWDIO\n9 TMS 10 SWCLK 11 TDI 12 DBG1 13 TDO 14 NRST 15 GND 16 GND" (at 323.85 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2718fc8e-ab33-5314-8cdb-ed2c833e96ea))
  (hierarchical_label "I2C_SCL" (shape input) (at 71.12 81.28 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid fa3aec64-56fc-5f38-a9ff-24491c96f935))
  (hierarchical_label "I2C_SDA" (shape bidirectional) (at 71.12 83.82 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 967a260e-7e0a-5167-b32d-7e2a143b7cfd))
  (label "FPGA_CLK" (at 114.3 71.12 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2af6a147-9799-5292-b01a-a631ed9d4f5a))
  (hierarchical_label "MCU_CLK" (shape output) (at 114.3 76.2 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 527bc78b-a8c5-59e4-bdc0-d60566acb477))
  (label "CLK2_FPGA" (at 114.3 81.28 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e2cea96d-e3a4-5ae7-89c5-987bcbc9ec3f))
  (text "MS5351M: CLK0 -> FPGA_CLK (RPLL_T_in pin 33), CLK1 -> MCU_CLK (STM32 HSE bypass),\nCLK2 -> FPGA pin 24 (spare clock / beat mode). One 100 nF each at VDD and VDDO." (at 31.75 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5d4b58ad-15c8-50b6-97af-26a2f8ff7680))
  (text "Pin plan (UG842), permuted for the 6-layer fan-out: TAP0..5 = 28-32, 34; TAP6/7 = 41, 47;\nTAP8..15 = 8-11, 13-16; COARSE = 27 (GCLKT_3); SPI SCK/MISO/MOSI/CS = 19/20/21/23; ADC_TRIG 17;\nCLK2 24; FPGA_CLK 33 (RPLL_T_in). Strobes OSER10 on IOT16A/B, IOT17A/B; config, JTAG, DBG2 (pin 6) fixed.\nUnused: 18, 22." (at 190.5 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6d8f512a-6e57-5bf6-9f62-e96c6bcb9b02))
